  "title": "Aargau Carrot Cake",
  "description": "Canton Aargau is composed of Switzerland&#39;s most fertile farmlands, celebrated for fruit, vegetables and the famous Carrot Cake. Moist, delicious and light, it contains no added fat besides what&#39;s naturally contained in the eggs.",
  "authors": [
